@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/logs
@token = REPLACE_AFTER_LOGIN

### Get all logs for the authenticated user
GET {{baseUrl}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Filter logs by name
GET {{baseUrl}}?name=push
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Filter logs by date range
GET {{baseUrl}}?from=2026-01-01&to=2026-03-31
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Filter logs by gear used (for stats: which workouts used these shoes)
GET {{baseUrl}}?gear=Nike Vaporfly
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Combine filters
GET {{baseUrl}}?name=run&from=2026-01-01&to=2026-06-30&gear=Nike Vaporfly
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
